                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The American people: We want lower prices!\n\nRepublicans: We\u2019re actually going to raise prices by getting into a trade war. But it\u2019s all worth it because then we\u2019ll be able to support the President\u2019s policies to cut Medicaid, SNAP, and Social Security. We are so back!",
