                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans have made one thing clear: they want to cut Medicaid.\n\nThey\u2019ll deny it, but actions speak louder than words, and Republicans have already taken steps to slash Medicaid.\n\nDemocrats will fight back.",
