                "quoted_status_profile_username": "atrupar",
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I was curious how Republicans would spin their Medicaid cuts, and it\u2019s just as ridiculous as I expected.\n\nWhen they say \"reforms\" to Medicaid, they mean cuts.\n\nReforms = Cuts.",
