                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Honored to be named a top healthcare leader in NJ by @INSIDER__NJ (glad to share the title with @FrankPallone !).\n\nAs a physician & member of the Congressional Doctors Caucus, I\u2019ll keep fighting for patients, providers & better care. https://t.co/bcsyOokZVd",
