                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "$1.5 trillion in cuts all but guarantees devastating blows to Medicaid, Social Security, and SNAP.\n\nThese might not be \u201cessential\u201d to the billionaires @SpeakerJohnson is catering to \u2014 but to everyday Americans, they\u2019re critical.",
