                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As both a Congressman and a doctor, it is clear to me just how devastating cuts to Medicaid would be for millions of Americans.\n\nRead my Op-Ed below:\nhttps://t.co/HlAchNYnWn",
