                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I asked VA Secretary Collins if he would protect the veterans who will lose their health care if Republicans\u2019 gut Medicaid. \n\nHis response? He said he \u201cdoesn\u2019t foresee that happening.\u201d A ludicrous thing to say when Republicans voted for billions in Medicaid cuts just last night in committee. \n\nRoughly 1 in 10 veterans rely on Medicaid as their primary form of healthcare. Sec. Collins, what are you going to do to protect them?",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1747412196,
                "view_count": 484
            },
