                "text": "Jokes about Elon and Trump aside, we\u2019re witnessing the world\u2019s two most powerful people argue while our government cuts basic services and looks to kick millions of people off of their healthcare.\u00a0\n\nThe American people deserve better. https://t.co/wCF9UOkGQG",
